# Optional custom Chromium install location; normally leave unset.
# PLAYWRIGHT_BROWSERS_PATH=/absolute/path/to/playwright-browsers
# BrowserSkill pairing and REA registration use their own tool configuration.
# No model API key is required by RETA; the host harness supplies reasoning.
